WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:05.550
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and a bunch of
Flash related stuff has happened since I posted

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:09.330
my Arrow video including the first look at
Grant Gustin’s Flash Costume.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:12.380
So I’m going to be combining that with my
regular Arrow Q&amp;A.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:15.320
If you’re finding me for the first time,
the Flash TV Show has started to blow up so

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:19.340
much that I’m doing weekly Flash videos
in addition to Arrow every week.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:24.230
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:27.610
So first let’s talk about the new Flash
Costume and then I’ll get to your questions.

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:31.500
Number 1 - As predicted, it’s based on the
New 52 version of the suit.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.180
The image they released is only of the mask,
but expect the rest of the costume to look

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.020
a lot like the New 52 suit.

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:39.450
It won’t be exact, but really really close.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:43.750
If you look closely you can see that the material
makes it look like a tech suit more than say

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:47.150
lycra or leather like Stephen Amell’s Arrow
costume.

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:48.520
I totally love the look.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:51.829
I think it’s awesome that they’re sticking
with the pre-established comic book version

00:00:51.829 --> 00:00:53.310
instead of going the Smallville route.

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:58.060
I don’t expect them to reveal the entire
costume until they’re ready to air the pilot.

00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:01.540
The CW is also airing the Supernatural Tribes
pilot on April 29th.

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:05.379
So it’s not out of the realm of possibilities
that they could air The Flash Pilot too.

00:01:05.379 --> 00:01:09.440
Filming starts this week and Grant Gustin
and the rest of the cast have been instagramming

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:11.190
the shit out of Vancouver.

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:15.441
Rick Cosnett who’s playing Edward Thawne
aka Professor Zoom even took a picture of

00:01:15.441 --> 00:01:18.220
the Vancouver skyline calling it Keystone
City.

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:21.640
The show will take place in Central City,
if you’re not familiar though Keystone City

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:24.670
is the origin of the Jay Garrick and Wally
West Flash’s.

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:28.680
During Wally West’s run as the main Flash
Gorilla Grodd and the Rogue’s also started

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:31.060
attacking Keystone City instead of Central
City.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:35.320
It’s also the current location of the Flash
Museum after the first one in Central City

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:38.130
was destroyed by the Hunter Zolomon Zoom.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:42.100
No idea yet as to how it will be featured
in the new Flash TV Show, but expect a lot

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.100
of easter eggs.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:45.810
Hopefully we’ll get to see Grant Gustin
in the Museum.

00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:50.920
That would definitely strengthen the rumor
that John Wesley Shipp is playing Jay Garrick.

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:54.830
I’ll report more from the set next week.

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:57.920
Let me know what your reactions are to Grant
Gustin’s Flash costume.

00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:00.040
Now let’s get to your questions!

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:04.880
Number 1 - Magus 3691 asks What will happen
to Laurel now that she is cleaning herself

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:08.239
up? and When will they have Roy more involved
with the Arrow Team?﻿

00:02:08.239 --> 00:02:11.390
She’s probably going to start pursuing Brother
Blood again.

00:02:11.390 --> 00:02:14.282
I think the show is going to give her the
satisfaction of taking him down.

00:02:14.282 --> 00:02:17.569
And Roy will be a big part of next week’s
episode The Promise.

00:02:17.569 --> 00:02:21.370
I’ll talk more about him in a predictions
video.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:26.519
Question 2 - Ali Camel asks When do you think
the flash TV show will start airing?

00:02:26.519 --> 00:02:32.529
The expectation is that it will air back to
back with Arrow so it can benefit from the

00:02:32.529 --> 00:02:33.870
built-in audience.

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:37.590
Since Arrow is already really early they would
probably air it after.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:41.099
Typically when they do things like that the
bigger show goes first to draw in more eyeballs,

00:02:41.099 --> 00:02:42.959
hoping that they’ll stick around for whatever’s
next.

00:02:42.959 --> 00:02:47.620
That’s why they put the brand new show this
year, The Tomorrow People right after Arrow.

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:52.279
Question 3 - Scott Smart asks If this doesn't
get an A from you, what kind of episode will?

00:02:52.279 --> 00:02:55.760
I really like to reserve the best grade or
rating or whatever for the very few things

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:58.810
that I think are the best of all the things
I watch.

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:02.390
So I don’t just compare episode of Arrow
to other episodes of Arrow.

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:06.889
I’m comparing it to Walking Dead and Game
of Thrones and Doctor Who.

00:03:06.889 --> 00:03:09.720
Ideally there would only be a few A’s per
season.

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:13.510
Just because it’s not an A doesn’t mean
it wasn’t awesome though.

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:18.519
Question 4 - vegtabadass asks Question do
you think Slade will turn Roy to his side

00:03:18.519 --> 00:03:19.620
or at least try?

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:23.659
Yes, I think you or someone else made the
Anakin Skywalker - Emperor comment.

00:03:23.659 --> 00:03:27.849
He’ll definitely try, but the funny thing
about Arrow is that like most comic book stories,

00:03:27.849 --> 00:03:30.010
it’s not super hard to predict the outcome.

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:34.150
He’ll almost turn Roy and then in the hour
of need he’ll rally back to the good side.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.150
In this case though, no.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:39.029
I think Roy will go a little nuts, but he
won’t start working with Slade.

00:03:39.029 --> 00:03:44.659
Question 5 - Joe Kerr asks Are blue beetle,
metal men or booster gold are going to make

00:03:44.659 --> 00:03:45.659
appearance?

00:03:45.659 --> 00:03:48.290
So yeah, there have been all the Kord Industries
easter eggs.

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:51.639
They have stuff in development, but in terms
of who would come on first?

00:03:51.639 --> 00:03:53.120
I would say Ted Kord.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.579
And it would play out like the Grant Gustin
episodes.

00:03:55.579 --> 00:04:00.379
He’d reveal himself as Blue Beetle to Oliver
over the course of a two part episode.

00:04:00.379 --> 00:04:03.760
Booster Gold is also really high on the list
of people I think Geoff Johns would like to

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:04.760
see on the show.

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:07.579
They usually reserve big news like that for
Comic Con though.

00:04:07.579 --> 00:04:11.569
So expect to find out which big new characters
are coming in a couple months.

00:04:11.569 --> 00:04:16.549
Question 6 - Laxus Dreyar asks Do you think
Laurel finally deciding to in no uncertain

00:04:16.549 --> 00:04:20.850
terms "grow up" was because of what Oliver
said to her about having loved her half his

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:23.420
life but that he was finally done?﻿

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:26.870
I think she was already on the fence and he
just helped push her over.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.920
I think it was mostly Sara and her family
that were helping her.

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:35.390
But he did kind of verbally slap some sense
into her.

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:40.020
Question 7 - Rick Grimes asks Do you think
team arrow will try to fight Slade next episode

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:42.040
but then get beaten badly?

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:45.150
You’re not looking so good Rick, you should
really put a band aid on that.

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:49.700
I think that Oliver’s face is going to look
like your face after next week.

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:52.280
Roy is also supposed to get his ass kicked
too.

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:56.330
Question 8 - Smoak and Arrow says I think
Slade hacked the phone to lure Oliver there

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:59.000
so he was totally caught off guard by Slade's
presence.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:03.910
Yeah, that was weird, I think it was either
Slade manipulating Oliver or Thea had been

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:06.040
kidnapped and was trying to get help.

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:07.880
We’ll find out next week.

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:13.010
Question 9 - Mobbmaster asks Will Felicity
train a bit or something sort of like that?

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:16.780
Yes, the writers said that Felicity would
continue to train with Diggle, there won’t

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:20.150
be any big training montage scenes like last
week, but it’s implied that she’s still

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:22.020
learning how to physically defend herself.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:24.700
She’ll always be wonderfully clumsy though.

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:29.210
Question 10 - leigh slaydragons asks do you
think that Slades, "I will corrupt those he

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:32.380
loves" refers to Sara with the huntress or
Moira?

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:33.380
﻿

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:35.430
Yes, I definitely think he’ll try to corrupt
or kill Sara.

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:38.230
In his speech he said “Kill Those Who Follow
Him.”

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:43.330
I think when he talked about those he loves
he was just talking about his family, so Thea

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:45.530
and Moira.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:49.190
Moira is one of the most corrupt people on
the show already.

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:54.500
Bonus question - thedeentheory asks will there
ever be a time when the "island story" is

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:57.690
finished and the present day stories keep
going?﻿

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:00.830
Remember when they told the island story from
Sara’s perspective.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:03.210
I think they’ll do a little more of that.

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:04.950
But he was on the island for 5 years.

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:06.450
Which is a lot of time.

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:09.460
So I think they’ll get creative and add
new dimensions to the island.

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:13.650
I’m also hoping someday they’ll tell Flashback
stories for Sara’s training with the League

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:14.650
of Assassins.

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:16.600
Thanks so much for submitting your questions
again.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:20.990
I’m sure while I was making this you all
thought up a billion more about Grant Gustin’s

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:21.990
Flash Costume.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.680
Feel free to write all those in the comments
and I’ll try to answer them there.

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:27.400
Remember, next week is huge.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:32.750
The Promise is supposed to make the Season
1 finale look like a bad student film.

